  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing and Responding to Violent Extremism (PVE) in the Atlantic Corridor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To prevent and address the immediate localized drivers of radicalization leading to violent extremism in target communities in Benin, Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire, Ghana and Togo, while providing support to strengthening the &#x2018;Infrastructures for Peace&#x2019;, namely mechanisms for early warning, and early response at local-level.</narrative>
  </description>
